 "_about": "Fireside Patience prototype sounds. Each suit has a soft paper slide with its own short tone: a warm low bell for hearts, a bright high bell for diamonds, a soft wooden knock for clubs and a deep wooden knock for spades. A flip is a quick paper snap. A legal place is a soft felt tap, a refused one a muffled low thud. The stock turn is a short paper shuffle, undo a soft reverse swish, the row change a quiet two-note chime and nope a dull tap. A complete foundation is a bright celesta chime and the win a warm harp and celesta flourish. The fireside bed is brown-noise fire with crackle pops and a slow clock tick, far under speech on the ambience bus.",
